  "description": "Grace Shaw has big plans and no time for inter-personal relationships. Until a cheeky VR game hacks its way into her holotech hair-clip. If she fixes the glitchy code, it’s hers to keep. The only catch? She needs a Player Two. And while she’s playing to win, Levin is playing for keeps. What starts as a shortcut to success spirals into a messy, mysterious drama that rakes up her past and shakes loose every doubt and dream. Finishing the game means untangling her own inner code, but Levin might be the system error she never saw coming.\nSource: Webtoon",
